 account was deactivated without any clear explanation of what rule I supposedly violated or what I did wrong. What makes this even more frustrating is that I had not been actively using the app when the deactivation occurred.\n\nThis is now the third time my account has been reviewed, yet I have never received a specific explanation identifying the alleged violation or the activity that supposedly triggered the action. How can an account be determined to be in violation when the app was not even being used?\n\nI have reached out for clarification, but I should not have to repeatedly defend my account without being told what I am actually accused of doing. If WhatsApp is going to deactivate someone's account, there should be transparency about the specific policy allegedly violated and the reason for the action.\n\nVery frustrating and unacceptable customer service experience. I expected better from a platform of this size.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=310633997&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id0"}, "name": {"label": "Reviewer 28"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-10-05T13:11:08-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "26.39.73"}, "id": {"label": "14631868849"}, "title": {"label": "🥰"}, "content": {"label": "the app i blocked my ex bsf on! lovely app", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=310633997&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id0"}, "name": {"label